OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner found guilty of 'violent'
OL,4,Acellmate murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inmate who strangled his cellmate
OL,7,Fbefore telling prison officers "I've
OL,8,Fkilled my padmate" has been found
OL,9,Fguilty of murder.
OL,11,FJonathan Alcide, 36, killed Neil Ashby,
OL,12,F49 at HMP Stoke Heath in July last
OL,13,Fyear.
OL,15,FAlcide denied murder, claiming he was
OL,16,Fnot guilty by reason of insanity, and
OL,17,Fwas instead guilty of manslaughter by
OL,18,Fdiminished responsibility.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
