OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner found guilty of 'violent'
OL,4,Acellmate murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut he was convicted of murder after a
OL,7,Fjury at Stafford Crown Court came to a
OL,8,Funanimous guilty verdict on Friday
OL,9,Fafter nine hours of deliberation. Judge
OL,10,FAvik Mukherjee said he would be
OL,11,Fsentenced on 17 November.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
